DAO DAO gauges
---------------

The gauge orchestrator and marketing adapter were imported from WyndDAO into
this repository in commit 7b5813cf0f354396143dbc86485ca5ed93809a4b and
subsequently modified by DAO DAO contributors. The budget allocator was added
in this repository. The shared gauge interface was extracted from the imported
orchestrator/adapter protocol.
